<title>INDIA: Ceat quotes on government securities - April 9.</title>
<headline>Ceat quotes on government securities - April 9.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceat Financial Services said it made the following two-way quotes on Wednesday for dated Government securities and treasury bills.</p>
<p>Government securities</p>
<p>---------------------</p>
<p>Particulars		    Bid/Offer	 Ytm(%)</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>13.65% 2007		 102.50/103.00    13.26/13.17</p>
<p>13.85% 2006A		103.50/104.00    13.25/13.16</p>
<p>14.00% 2006		 104.00/104.80    13.25/13.10</p>
<p>* Quotes are available from CFSLs dealing room in Mumbai, at the telephone nos. 2886433 &amp; 2851131.</p>
